/Title (I am an aspiring architect with a growing passion for community-based design, photorealistic rendering, and storytelling through visuals. With four years of experience in events, product and portrait photography, I bring a keen eye for composition, light, and detail into my architectural work. My design approach is rooted in creating spaces that are people-focused, context-aware, and emotionally engaging. I also have hands-on experience in construction, which informs my practical understanding of materials and building processes. I strive to merge creativity with functionality, always aiming to design spaces that serve, inspire, and connect)
